OL,3,GNEWSA'Dangerous' paedophile who
OL,4,Adiscussed abuse online is jailed for 21
OL,5,Ayears
OL,6,
OL,7,FA predatory and dangerous paedophile
OL,8,Fwho abused a young child and used
OL,9,Fchatrooms to plan the abuse of others
OL,10,Fhas been jailed for 21 years.
OL,12,FCraig Henton, 54, was tracked down from
OL,13,Fan encrypted messaging app where he had
OL,14,Fsaid he had planned to commit sexual
OL,15,Foffences against a five-year-old girl.
OL,17,FInvestigators found more than 4,000
OL,18,Findecent images and videos at Henton's
OL,19,Fhome in Port Talbot.
